WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
beautiful planet, a planet that we all share,

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.480
a planet of peace and a world that is richer,

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.520
better, and more beautiful than ever before.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.720
That can happen.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:09.960
It will happen.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.380
It will happen, and I hope it can happen

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.220
and start right now, right at this moment.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:16.360
We'll turn it around.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:19.400
We're going to make our countries better, safer,

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.799
more beautiful.

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:22.100
We're going to take care of our people.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:22.940
Thank you very much.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:23.639
It's been an honor.

00:00:23.639 --> 00:00:25.799
God bless the nations of the world.

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:26.639
Thank you very much.

00:00:26.639 --> 00:00:27.299
Bye.

00:00:27.299 --> 00:00:28.780
Thank you very much.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.780
Thank you very much.

